  <meta name="description" content="CG, via funding from Good Ventures, is surging budgets in 2026 across all categories. I&#39;m particularly happy about this Givewell focused grant (larger than last year&#39;s *entire* budget!). It&#39;s timed and designed to scale the field ahead of the anticipated wave of new funders next year.

